{
  "category": "integrate-and-fire routing",
  "version": "2026-10-10",
  "note": "v2 action-head runs. Fast recipe (I and A variants): D0's pipeline (SDT-V3, spike_text_only fusion, Shiftmax spike head, 8 continuous state tokens, light RGB augmentation, no KD) as 4 GPUs x 80 without accumulation for 32k steps, the same 10.24M samples as 256 x 40k, learning rates scaled by sqrt(320/256) (other 5.6e-5, vision 1.12e-5). I0 adds Integrate-and-Fire Routing (learned patch position, integrated routing, 2-bit score shift, separate state Shiftmax); I1-I4 each remove one of these. I5 replaces the separate state Shiftmax with locate (position values) and is the starting point of the SGSA ablation: I8 adds the fine normalizer (Shiftmax exponent rounded to 1/16), A1 the sign field, I7 both. I6 (spatial score integration) and I9 (I7 with integer context events) are further ablations. Final recipe (F variants): the v1 standard recipe (global 256 x 40k, warmup 5000, seed 42, KD with 0.1 feature / 0.1 action weights, learning rates 5e-5 / 1e-5) as 4 GPUs x 64 without accumulation; F7 carries I7's head (SGSA, the v2 final model), F9 I9's. Compare with the v1 base (spike-driven-vla, 8 x 32).",
